<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">07062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Russian favorability in Armenia has collapsed to fourteen percent... and on Sunday, voters decide whether to finish the turn toward Europe.</s> <s>After Nagorno-Karabakh fell in twenty twenty-three and Moscow stood aside, Prime Minister Pashinyan staked his future on the European Union, against three parties backed from Moscow.</s> <s>If his slate falls short of a majority, he may face prosecution or exile — and the South Caucasus tilts west.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Kim Yo Jong, sister of North Korea's leader, has declared the country's nuclear program absolutely non-negotiable.</s> <s>Pyongyang wrote its nuclear status into its constitution in twenty twenty-three, and her statement landed on the eve of Xi Jinping's first visit in seven years.</s> <s>Because China remains North Korea's economic lifeline, the timing tells Beijing the arsenal is meant to be permanent.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Pentagon has rated Israel a critical espionage threat against the United States.</s> <s>American personnel found surveillance software on their phones inside Israel, and Israeli officers were caught planting listening devices at Defense Intelligence Agency headquarters in twenty twenty-one.</s> <s>Washington may now restrict those officers' access — a rare public rupture between two close allies.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ballistic missiles struck Kuwait and Bahrain on Friday, widening the Gulf war well beyond Iran's borders.</s> <s>Tehran has held the Strait of Hormuz in a chokehold since the conflict began, and American forces answered with strikes on Qeshm Island.</s> <s>The two capitals are said to be talking even as the missiles fly.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's national medical entrance exam faces fresh accusations that question papers have leaked again.</s> <s>The testing agency cancelled May's sitting after teachers allegedly sold papers for a million rupees, and the Central Bureau of Investigation is now prosecuting.</s> <s>A retest is set for the twenty-first of June, with the futures of millions of students hanging on whether it stays clean.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A London jury has cleared three Kurdish activists of belonging to the Kurdistan Workers' Party.</s> <s>Britain banned the group in two thousand one under pressure from Turkey, a move that criminalized ordinary diaspora organizing alongside armed struggle.</s> <s>Three other defendants still face retrial, and the verdict tests how far an anti-terror law can reach into a community's identity.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Standard and Poor's five hundred has refused to admit SpaceX, blocking it on the grounds that it isn't consistently profitable.</s> <s>Some seven and a half trillion dollars in passive funds track the index, so inclusion would have forced roughly fourteen billion dollars in automatic buying.</s> <s>SpaceX, OpenAI and Anthropic all remain outside the index that defines the American market — a gap between the hype and the ledger.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Islamic economy's era of breakneck growth is ending, according to this year's State of the Global Islamic Economy report.</s> <s>Sukuk bonds, takaful insurance, and halal food have all grown large enough to set global standards rather than chase them.</s> <s>Regulatory harmonization, the report warns, is the bottleneck still holding the Muslim world's markets back from full integration.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russia says its technology sector booked thirty-nine billion dollars in the first quarter, up eight percent.</s> <s>Western vendors fled after twenty twenty-two, and domestic software has rushed into the vacuum, growing twenty-one percent in a single year.</s> <s>These figures are self-reported through state channels, so the boom may be real, inflated, or a little of both.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan has set aside one hundred seventy-nine billion rupees for dams that officials say need five hundred billion.</s> <s>That shortfall threatens timelines on Diamer-Bhasha and Dasu, the country's two largest dams, as an IMF program squeezes the development budget.</s> <s>Ordinary Pakistanis will pay later, in power shortages and weaker defense against flood and drought.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Researchers have mapped the thawing permafrost beneath Norway's Svalbard archipelago, building by building, using satellite ground-movement data.</s> <s>As the frozen ground softens, its active layer thickens and destabilizes the foundations under homes and heritage sites across the far north.</s> <s>The dataset is a preview of the adaptation bill now coming due across the entire Arctic.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Yeasts more than five thousand three hundred years old are still alive on the body of Ötzi, the alpine iceman.</s> <s>Scientists in Bolzano confirmed through DNA damage patterns that the microbes predate his discovery, and cold-adapted relatives still grow in nearby glaciers.</s> <s>Whether they slept dormant for five millennia or colonized him after exhumation is still unknown.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A doctor has been cleared of the Bundibugyo strain of Ebola after evacuation from an outbreak in the Democratic Republic of Congo.</s> <s>He recovered inside a high-containment unit in Berlin, while the communities he left behind face the same virus without anything close to such infrastructure.</s> <s>That East African outbreak is still spreading, and its true scale remains unclear.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Europe is drafting a second Chips Act, paired with a Cloud and Artificial Intelligence Development Act, to cut its dependence on American and Chinese suppliers.</s> <s>The bloc today makes neither leading-edge chips nor competitive cloud at anything like the scale it needs.</s> <s>Both laws set targets but no timetables, leaving that dependency gap wide open for now.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Fake artificial-intelligence apps have become the year's favorite malware lure, with researchers logging more than ninety-two thousand attacks since January.</s> <s>Counterfeit ChatGPT apps alone made up nearly half the cases, carrying banking trojans and spyware hidden inside familiar branding.</s> <s>One group was even caught distributing fake Claude apps across all three major operating systems.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>